em that they're going to &quot;regret meeting him&quot; sounds more in line with either a Fatalist or a Wretch.<br /> <br /> <b>-p. 42</b> Lady Zhalana has overspent either 1 Freebie Point or 3 Freebie point.<br /> <br /> Note: Unsure to which one as Wilder provides a free dot to either Glamour or Willpower, and Chuck has a +1 over the chara-gen minimum for Glamour and +2 for Willpower, and she hasn't taken any additional Traits that neatly fit into the 5 freebie point bonus from Flaws.<br /> <br /> <b>-p.46</b> Dominic Lowell has 1 unspent point of Freebie Points.<br /> <br /> Additionally, no specialty is listed for Appearance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T11:13:49-08:00","id":1161561,"title":"","content":"-<b>p. 50</b> Lashaya &quot;Prophecy&quot; Ellis has 1 unspent point of Freebie Points<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}